{"dur": 27.55, "fps": 30, "segments": [{"id": "hook", "text": "Est-ce que l'intelligence artificielle va remplacer l'ingénieur ?", "t0": 1.2, "t1": 5.113, "words": [{"w": "Est-ce", "t": 1.2}, {"w": "que", "t": 1.567}, {"w": "l'intelligence", "t": 1.811}, {"w": "artificielle", "t": 2.729}, {"w": "va", "t": 3.523}, {"w": "remplacer", "t": 3.707}, {"w": "l'ingénieur", "t": 4.318}, {"w": "?", "t": 5.052}]}, {"id": "suspense", "text": "Je vais te donner la vraie réponse.", "t0": 5.913, "t1": 8.25, "words": [{"w": "Je", "t": 5.913}, {"w": "vais", "t": 6.113}, {"w": "te", "t": 6.447}, {"w": "donner", "t": 6.647}, {"w": "la", "t": 7.115}, {"w": "vraie", "t": 7.315}, {"w": "réponse.", "t": 7.716}]}, {"id": "non", "text": "Non. Et ça n'arrivera pas.", "t0": 9.15, "t1": 10.627, "words": [{"w": "Non.", "t": 9.15}, {"w": "Et", "t": 9.386}, {"w": "ça", "t": 9.563}, {"w": "n'arrivera", "t": 9.741}, {"w": "pas.", "t": 10.39}]}, {"id": "pourquoi", "text": "Parce que la machine calcule… mais elle ne porte rien. C'est l'ingénieur qui décide, et qui signe le plan.", "t0": 11.007, "t1": 16.823, "words": [{"w": "Parce", "t": 11.007}, {"w": "que", "t": 11.327}, {"w": "la", "t": 11.54}, {"w": "machine", "t": 11.7}, {"w": "calcule…", "t": 12.127}, {"w": "mais", "t": 12.874}, {"w": "elle", "t": 13.141}, {"w": "ne", "t": 13.408}, {"w": "porte", "t": 13.568}, {"w": "rien.", "t": 13.888}, {"w": "C'est", "t": 14.155}, {"w": "l'ingénieur", "t": 14.475}, {"w": "qui", "t": 15.115}, {"w": "décide,", "t": 15.329}, {"w": "et", "t": 15.702}, {"w": "qui", "t": 15.862}, {"w": "signe", "t": 16.076}, {"w": "le", "t": 16.396}, {"w": "plan.", "t": 16.556}]}, {"id": "civrebar", "text": "CivRebar AI ne prend pas ta place. Il prend ton travail répétitif.", "t0": 17.203, "t1": 22.425, "words": [{"w": "CivRebar", "t": 17.203}, {"w": "AI", "t": 17.926}, {"w": "ne", "t": 18.167}, {"w": "prend", "t": 18.408}, {"w": "pas", "t": 18.89}, {"w": "ta", "t": 19.211}, {"w": "place.", "t": 19.452}, {"w": "Il", "t": 19.934}, 